Package: autosync
Version: __VERSION__
Section: web
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: debconf (>= 0.5) | debconf-2.0, coreutils, rsync
Recommends: docker.io, docker-compose-v2
Installed-Size: __INSTALLED_SIZE__
Maintainer: AutoSync Internal <noreply@autosync.local>
Description: AutoSync — internal auto-service platform (Ozon pricing + repair orders)
 AutoSync bundles two modules behind one web UI: Ozon competitor-price
 monitoring / card generation, and repair-order part matching against
 supplier cross-references with an LLM fallback. The stack (Flask API,
 Celery, React frontend, local LLM via Ollama, PostgreSQL, Redis) runs
 under Docker Compose.
 .
 Installing this package deploys the application into a directory you
 choose during setup, builds and starts the Docker Compose stack as a
 systemd service, creates an initial administrator account, and prints
 the URL to access the web UI.
